OL,3,GNEWSAStillbirth failings 'have to
OL,4,Astop', mum tells Trust
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum whose baby died during pregnancy
OL,7,Fhas said the number of stillbirths
OL,8,Foccurring under the watch of one NHS
OL,9,FTrust "has to stop".
OL,11,FGeorgia Blinston Jones, from
OL,12,FCanterbury, claims she experienced a
OL,13,Fnumber of mistakes in the care she
OL,14,Freceived prior to losing her unborn son
OL,15,FRowan at 39 weeks, which left her
OL,16,Ffeeling suicidal.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
