OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAStillbirth failings 'have to
OL,4,Astop', mum tells Trust
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, East Kent Hospitals NHS
OL,7,FTrust apologised for "failing families"
OL,8,Fafter an independent review found eight
OL,9,Fbabies, stillborn at its hospitals
OL,10,Fbetween June 2025 and March 2026, might
OL,11,Fhave survived with better care.
OL,13,FBlinston Jones said while the findings
OL,14,F"can't change what's happened with
OL,15,FRowan", she hopes it "will make a
OL,16,Fdifference for other expectant
OL,17,Fmothers".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
